      hu: "Jól megőrzött erődváros a Csoszon-dinasztia idejéből. Más népi falvakkal ellentétben itt ma is laknak lakosok.",
      ro: "Un oraș-fortăreață bine conservat din dinastia Joseon. Spre deosebire de alte sate populare, rezidenții încă locuiesc aici.",
      en: "A well-preserved fortress town from the Joseon Dynasty. Unlike other folk villages, residents still live here today."
